# Discussion post drafts — content gets pasted straight into GitHub Discussions,
# not tracked in the repo itself.
docs/discussions/

# Release notes drafts — content gets pasted straight into the GitHub Release
# description, not tracked in the repo itself.
docs/release-notes/

# Wiki page drafts — pushed into the separate scribemate.wiki.git repo,
# not tracked in the main repo itself.
docs/wiki/

# Forum/launch post drafts — content gets pasted straight into external sites
# (itch.io, RoyalRoad, Reddit, etc.), not tracked in the repo itself.
docs/forum-posts/
